Cell["\<\
A 3-array has no flat picture of its own, so it is drawn as a row of \
matrices, the first index choosing the matrix:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"4ffb95fa-b3a9-9645-b704-9316cec79eb0"],

Cell["ArrayGraphics[Array[#1 + #2 + #3 &, {2, 2, 2}]]", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"b86e0db2-2c10-2c44-9d04-7ff97b3d92c7"],

